IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-TLS13-MEDIA-DND.

DATA DIVISION.
01 TLS13-TICKET-OK     PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 MEDIA-MATCHED-OK    PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 RDF-TRIPLES-CNT     PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 PLATFORM-SCORE      PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-TLS13-MEDIA-DND.
    IF TLS13-TICKET-OK == 0
        GO TO ERROR-STATE.
    END-IF.

    IF MEDIA-MATCHED-OK == 0
        GO TO ERROR-STATE.
    END-IF.

    IF RDF-TRIPLES-CNT == 0
        GO TO ERROR-STATE.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 9999 TO PLATFORM-SCORE.
    SET depth 2.
    WEIGHT 32 TLS13-TICKET-OK.
    WEIGHT 30 RDF-TRIPLES-CNT.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 10.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-STATE.
    MOVE 0 TO PLATFORM-SCORE.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
